d 'CSDLP': module to compute causal state-dependent local projections:
d
d      csdlp implements the causal state-dependent local
d projections of David, Giacomini, Jiao and Wang (2026). For each
d horizon h it	  estimates	   Y_{i,t+h} = g_h(Z_{i,t-1}) X_t +
d W'_{i,t-1} gamma_h + u_{i,t+h}    where g_h(.) is an unknown
d function of a predetermined micro state. Under causal shock
d exogeneity (Assumption 1), a	  predetermined state (Assumption
d 2) and the conditional-mean condition that the outcome is linear
d in the shock with a	 state-dependent coefficient (Assumption
d 3), g_h(z) is the total causal impulse response per unit shock
d for units with state z.    The state may be endogenous (it may
d depend on past shocks). 
d
d KW: local projections
d KW: state-dependency
d KW: causal shock
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261110
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f csdlp.ado
f csdlp.sthlp
